# From an open Batch Crop & Rotate room: cancel it (×, unapplied changes dropped) and open it again on photo 1
# (R3-c). Never use scrollto in this room: it sweeps the rotate slider. Use fingerdrag on the ratio row
# (900 1985 → 300 1985) to reach ratios further right.
id closeBtn
waitfor "Crop & Rotate" --timeout 10
lbl "Crop & Rotate"
waitfor Original --timeout 10
